{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","库露露"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名热衷爆炸的射手，可以将战场一分为二，擅长对敌方半场的敌人狂轰滥炸。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","准备吓一跳吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Hmph! Get ready to be scared!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哈！看我的！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Ha! Check this out!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","尽情轰炸！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","So many targets... So little time!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","才不会输……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I can't lose..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","啊哈！这是当然的！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Yup! I always win!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","残暴，炸裂，恐慌吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","How delightfully brutal and explosive."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","阿爆：完美！库露露：那——当然啦！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Boomboom: Perfect!\nKulu: Did you expect anything less?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","阿爆：库露露大人！美貌无双！库露露：行了行了"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Boomboom: Lady Kulu, you're as beautiful as ever!\nKulu: Yeah, yeah, I know."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","阿爆：统统爆炸！库露露：哎呀，谦虚点嘛！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Boomboom: Everything explode!\nKulu: Don't get overly excited."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","哇哈哈，进贡给我吗，我收下了！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","嗯，不错，留下吧！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","什、什么东西啊！离、离我、离我远点！"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","极限爆炸"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","爆炸是世界上最时髦的娱乐！"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","霓虹狂音"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","捂好耳朵！最具破坏力的娱乐要开始啦！"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","庆典甄礼活动累充获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","传说"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","库露露大人驾到！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","最近新流行的款式是……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我要超辣！最辣！无敌辣！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","库露露这个名字是她认为自己原本的名字有点太正式了，所以给自己取的时髦爱称——捎带一提，阿爆的名字也是她重新命名的。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","库露露的头发从造型到颜色，都是她用魔力和染料自己做的，阿爆也帮了不少忙。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","库露露实际上不太能吃辣，但因为她觉得吃辣比较有派头，所以只要有机会选口味，她总是会点超辣。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","阿爆有着统一的意识，可以无限分裂、吞噬其他炸弹，轰炸指定区域或目标——但大部分时间他的智慧都用于绞尽脑汁地吹捧库露露的实力与美貌。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","库露露的炸弹并不只是威力强悍，她能够直觉般地抓到最适合的炸点与时机，从而博得最强大的效果。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","某位不愿具名的影子恶魔评价过，哈拉克和库露露要比出个智力高下，那么阿爆应该大获全胜。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","有些让人意外的是，库露露并不喜欢烟花，她认为那些色彩过于多余和软弱。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","库露露的衣服是她自己采购的，资金来源于她帮忙炸掉某处老旧城堡得到的工钱，阿爆没敢提醒她：大部分恶魔的衣服都是自己幻化的。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","库露露从苏醒之后就没有和其他恶魔交流过，这让她对自身的实力与使命都有着一定程度上的错误认知。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","阿爆的意识是寄托于库露露作为恶魔的概念之上的，因此他拥有库露露所没有的经验和记忆——但这只代表他吹捧起库露露时会更加得心应手。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","哇哦，真难得，在这里能碰上懂时尚的人！"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415665.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","库露露 & 诡草"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","今天又完成了十四次完美无缺的爆炸！"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415673.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","库露露 & 祖娅"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","库露露大人驾到！"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415677.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","库露露"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","我要超辣！最辣！无敌辣！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415678.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","库露露"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","哼，这地方吵死了！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415739.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","库露露 & 阿爆 & 勒图姆"]]}